A||||13||jlruiz67||West Fest 2000||||6||
Z||000000||jlruiz67||07-09-2000||12:04 AM||||Hello All<BR>Just got back from WestFest2000 now this is going to be a long post. <P>    I started with my trip to San Diego only 67 miles, when I got to the Hotel, the parking lot was a site for sore eyes with a see of Fieros (Fiero Heaven) 49 in total. I started checking out all the cars as they were getting detailed for the judges and proud owners willing to answer any question you had. I was greeted like if I was one of them, its like they could smell it on you. I was looking for Robert and his yellow Fiero as he was on going to San Diego from San Francisco and he posted that on this forum. It was nice to find someone from Pennock's Forum there and we talked for a while about what else, Fieros. His car is great and he will post his experience I hope. I found great resources and information from just about everyone there, 3.4, turbo's, 3800,v8 engine conversions but no Northstar. Once again it was great. Another thing that I found is that the people from C.W.Products where really young and energetic, they will be a great resource for us and if you live in So Cal they are the only shop in town. The people from Golden Gate Fiero where great and they made a great impression on the Fest. The clubs that organized the Fest did a great job and I have no complains. I did not have a digital camera but I know that others did and they will be posting soon. I wish I could be there for the picnic tomorrow but I can't make it. If I can remember more I will post soon.<P><BR>We drive excitement.  <BR>||||reg||6
Z||000001||tgowens||07-09-2000||12:19 AM||||thanks for the report - it sounds like you had a great time -- I wish I could have been there with my club (Golden Gate Fieros) but I am in KY (going to the Nationals in a couple of weeks) -- <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/my_fiero_sig.gif">    <BR>'87 Fiero GT -  <A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A><p>[This message has been edited by tgowens (edited 07-09-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||DXR_DAD||07-09-2000||02:57 AM||||Thanks for that info Terry. Is that anywere near me???  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I guess that means I can make it next year.<BR>I hope all the GGF members had a good time<BR>and bring back some good pics, info, and any other good stuff!!!<BR>Terry I must have missed that info at the last meeting!!<P>DXR_DAD<BR><p>[This message has been edited by DXR_DAD (edited 07-09-2000).]||||reg||5
